<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 243 0 R/T(With an AUTO_INCREMENT column \(MySQL\) or a sequence the counter is advanced atomically inside the engine, so each insert receives a different number. The PRIMARY KEY and the UNIQUE keys are the last line of defence: if a duplicate ever reached the table it would be rejected \(see the failure tests in Task 8\). )/E(With an AUTO_INCREMENT column \(MySQL\) or a sequence the counter is advanced atomically inside the engine, so each insert receives a different number. The PRIMARY KEY and the UNIQUE keys are the last line of defence: if a duplicate ever reached the table it would be rejected \(see the failure tests in Task 8\). )/Pg 25 0 R/K[20]>>
