endobj

639 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 244 0 R/T(A ternary relationship COORDINATES\(LENDER, CURATOR, EXHIBITION\) looks attractive because a lender, a curator and an exhibition are all involved in a loan. To test whether it is really a three-way fact, I built a small instance and projected it to the three binary relationships. )/E(A ternary relationship COORDINATES\(LENDER, CURATOR, EXHIBITION\) looks attractive because a lender, a curator and an exhibition are all involved in a loan. To test whether it is really a three-way fact, I built a small instance and projected it to the three binary relationships. )/Pg 26 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

