670 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 245 0 R/T(Effect of missing LOAN_OBJECT evidence. I deliberately allow a loan line with zero reports \(minimum 0\). If a report were compulsory for the line \(minimum 1\), neither row could be created first: the report needs the line, and the line would need a report. Missing evidence is therefore handled by a query \(Task 9, Q2\) and a workflow rule, not by the structure. )/E(Effect of missing LOAN_OBJECT evidence. I deliberately allow a loan line with zero reports \(minimum 0\). If a report were compulsory for the line \(minimum 1\), neither row could be created first: the report needs the line, and the line would need a report. Missing evidence is therefore handled by a query \(Task 9, Q2\) and a workflow rule, not by the structure. )/Pg 27 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

