881 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 255 0 R/T(DISPLAY_SLOT is owned by EXHIBITION. Its local key is slot_no and its full key is \(exhibition_id, slot_no\). The link to the exhibition is an identifying link: exhibition_id is part of the primary key, the slot cannot be moved to another exhibition and it is deleted with its exhibition \(ON DELETE CASCADE\). An ordinary foreign key, such as LOAN.lender_id, is just a reference. It is not part of the key of LOAN, the loan keeps its own identity, and deleting the lender is blocked rather than cascaded. )/E(DISPLAY_SLOT is owned by EXHIBITION. Its local key is slot_no and its full key is \(exhibition_id, slot_no\). The link to the exhibition is an identifying link: exhibition_id is part of the primary key, the slot cannot be moved to another exhibition and it is deleted with its exhibition \(ON DELETE CASCADE\). An ordinary foreign key, such as LOAN.lender_id, is just a reference. It is not part of the key of LOAN, the loan keeps its own identity, and deleting the lender is blocked rather than cascaded. )/Pg 37 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

