1068 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 261 0 R/T(Why deletion is restricted for historical LOAN records. A loan is evidence of who had which object and when. If a lender, artifact or loan line could be deleted, the condition reports and placements that depend on it would be left without context, or deleted by a cascade, and the museum would lose evidence it may need for an insurance claim. Corrections are made by updating the row \(for example returned_date\), not by deleting it. The delete test in Task 8 shows the DBMS refusing to delete a loan that still has lines. )/E(Why deletion is restricted for historical LOAN records. A loan is evidence of who had which object and when. If a lender, artifact or loan line could be deleted, the condition reports and placements that depend on it would be left without context, or deleted by a cascade, and the museum would lose evidence it may need for an insurance claim. Corrections are made by updating the row \(for example returned_date\), not by deleting it. The delete test in Task 8 shows the DBMS refusing to delete a loan that still has lines. )/Pg 43 0 R/K[34]>>
endobj

