<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 296 0 R/T(The join to current owners returns more rows \(one per owner, 20% of the artifacts have two\) and takes about 1.6 to 3.2 times as long as reading the single column. Storage grows by 40% in this table \(1.4 rows per artifact\). The three verification queries are run once after migration and then as a periodic check, not on every transaction. )/E(The join to current owners returns more rows \(one per owner, 20% of the artifacts have two\) and takes about 1.6 to 3.2 times as long as reading the single column. Storage grows by 40% in this table \(1.4 rows per artifact\). The three verification queries are run once after migration and then as a periodic check, not on every transaction. )/Pg 78 0 R/K[29]>>
