endobj

2350 0 obj
<</Title(The report follows the twelve tasks in the assignment sheet in order. Tasks 1 to 7 are design work \(requirements, keys, relationships, ER, EER, weak entities and mapping\). Tasks 8 and 9 are the executed part: the schema was created, filled with generated data at four sizes, tested with invalid writes and checked with eight queries. Tasks 10 and 11 compare models and defend the final choice. Task 12 handles the changed requirement \(shared ownership with changing shares\).)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2031 0 R/Next 2351 0 R>>
endobj

2351 0 obj
<</Title(Every number shown as "actual output" in this report was produced by running the scripts, not typed by hand. The same random seed \(4211\) was used for all four population sizes, so the runs can be repeated and will give the same counts.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2031 0 R/Prev 2350 0 R>>
endobj

2352 0 obj
<</Title(Execution environment \(please read\))/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 2031 0 R/First 2735 0 R/Last 2735 0 R/Count -1/Next 2736 0 R>>
