2356 0 obj
<</Title(14. Run python3 generate_and_run.py 100, then 1000, 10000 and 100000. Each call creates its own database, loads it with seed 4211, runs the eight queries five times and writes the counts and median times.)/Dest[84 0 R/Fit]/Parent 89 0 R/Prev 2033 0 R/Next 2357 0 R>>
endobj

