<</Title(A ternary relationship COORDINATES\(LENDER, CURATOR, EXHIBITION\) looks attractive because a lender, a curator and an exhibition are all involved in a loan. To test whether it is really a three-way fact, I built a small instance and projected it to the three binary relationships.)/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 4404 0 R/Next 4430 0 R>>
